│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ butterfly_symmetry                                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ I kept the fixed data pipeline intact and redesigned the variational block around a       │
│                          │ symmetric “butterfly mixer” instead of the seed’s purely local chain. The main idea is to │
│                          │ move information across the 8-qubit register in a few long-range steps, then use          │
│                          │ shared-parameter phase and rotation layers to keep the model compact and less prone to    │
│                          │ overfitting.                                                                              │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ This design is inspired by hardware-efficient ansätze, but it is novel in how it          │
│                          │ combines:                                                                                 │
│                          │ - parity-tied entrance rotations,                                                         │
│                          │ - a multi-scale CZ butterfly mesh,                                                        │
│                          │ - coarse half-register RZ conditioning,                                                   │
│                          │ - centered RY refinement on the middle wires,                                             │
│                          │ - and long-range controlled rotations before a parity-aligned RX readout head.            │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ The result is a structured, parameter-efficient block that should generalize better while │
│                          │ still being expressive enough for the re-uploaded binary feature map.                     │
